{"id":"sommet","lemma":"sommet","pos":"noun","rank":2032,"glosses":["summit, peak","summit (a conference of leaders)","vertex (point on a curve with a local minimum or maximum of curvature)"],"ipa":"/sɔ.mɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/Fr-sommet.ogg/Fr-sommet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sommets"},"formAudio":{"sommets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-sommets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Monte au sommet.","en":"Climb to the top.","words":[{"g":"to go up, to climb","l":"monter"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Je peux voir le sommet de la montagne.","en":"I can see the top of the mountain.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"mountain"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Grimpons au sommet de cette montagne.","en":"Let's climb to the top of this mountain.","words":[{"g":"to climb, climb up","l":"grimper"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"mountain"}]},{"text":"Enfin, nous atteignîmes le sommet.","en":"At last, we reached the summit.","words":[{"g":"finally"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to attain","l":"atteindre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous n'avons pas atteint le sommet.","en":"We didn't reach the summit.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to attain","l":"atteindre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}